      "predicate": "iadas:limites",
      "object": "This includes methodological issues pertaining to the use of self-report measures, a small sample composed largely of Caucasian female athletes and the use of parametric methods to analyse nonparametric data. Next, athletes' scores on both measures were relatively healthy; therefore it is unclear whether the relationships observed in this study would extend to athletes with eating disorders and depression. Finally, it is not possible to make definitive conclusions about causality, as the findings are essentially correlational."
